{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgdYn7yYZRcfaTu3rJNHT","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Thrive Holdings has acquired ADT for $10 per share, about $7.6 billion in equity, according to the companies' announcement on Thursday. ADT puts the total enterprise value at $15.3 billion. Enterprise value generally counts obligations such as debt alongside equity, so the buyer is taking on considerably more than the headline share price suggests.\n\nThe buyer's structure matters here. Thrive Holdings is a holding company spun out of Josh Kushner's Thrive Capital, and it says it now holds more than 75 companies. Its stated aim is to own businesses long-term and revitalize them with AI. OpenAI is both an investor and a partner, supplying models, technology and forward-deployed engineers to the companies Thrive owns. Under this approach, an AI lab's tools and staff are placed directly inside an established operating company. Thrive is buying that company outright rather than selling software to it.\n\nWhat the deal does not yet include is a product. Neither company has said what AI-powered security offerings will come out of it. They have said only that they plan to invest and release new products, and that \"ADT will form the foundation of Thrive Holdings' smart home security business.\" For now, the AI case for the acquisition is an intention, with no product to judge it by.\n\nThe timing puts ADT in a crowded field. Apple has just entered home security with a new line of products developed with LG and Schneider Electric, and Amazon has updated its smart home range, including new AI-powered cameras. ADT already partners with Apple and Google and is expected to continue doing so. That leaves ADT working with Apple while Apple builds its own presence in the same market. Under new ownership, ADT will need AI products that justify a $15.3 billion valuation while it sells alongside, and against, the platforms it depends on."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2022,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2022},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"611c2f65-ce1a-4fdd-97bb-2cc127751ac9","uuid":"08dc0637-b5af-442f-965d-c050534113a1","timestamp":"2026-11-02T05:28:11.049Z","request_id":"req_011CgdYn7kep3dRj9eLqArvC"}
